":ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` = 4  PWM type RSSI fed to a dedicated GPIO pin"
msgstr ":ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` = 4  PWM型RSSI接入专用GPIO引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:63
#: 55fbb464c037423fa4b19042c3a41d35 71257f6738d9441eabcbe28d881d79aa
#: 7940ba89716d494e927720da790ec646 a72348d6276241dc9d23f3e2a2687c2d
#: b7c7163bc86a484ab082fbe5777d6ebf
msgid ""
":ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>`  Specifies the GPIO pin to read PWM type "
"RSSI from. On boards with IOMCU these are the AUX pins that can be used as "
"PWM output by default or alternatively set to be used as GPIO . See "
":ref:`common-gpios`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>` "
"指定用于读取PWM型RSSI的GPIO引脚。在带IOMCU的飞控板上，这些是默认可用作PWM输出或可选设置为GPIO的AUX引脚。参见 "
":ref:`common-gpios`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:71
#: 6f0ddcd686694ccda5c19d013b12d0a7 92f090a76dd64fc8946178a193160ab5
#: 99155d7c20fc464fb8b5481dabdf6ab6 dc8daadb61564452a789e1ffb78eaef2
#: ee24853baa5a497db882e5ac7e63021e
msgid ""
"Some radio receivers output inverted RSSI values (lowest voltage / PWM on "
"best reception), so _HIGH parameters may actually be set to lower values "
"than corresponding _LOW parameters for correct internal scaling to 0 - 100%."
msgstr ""
"某些RC接收机输出反转的RSSI值（信号最好时电压/PWM最低），因此_HIGH参数的实际值可能低于对应的_LOW参数，以实现正确的内部0 - "
"100%缩放。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:75
#: 79990dee6a234da7acf2c0dc4a9ed34a
msgid ""
"To read analog voltage type RSSI,  :ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>`  can be"
" set to any free ADC pin available. On pixhawk / cube type boards, this "
"includes the sBus out / RSSI input pin (103). When using dedicated ADC pins,"
" the corresponding pin number usually matches the ADC1 channel used on that "
"pin. See the DMA1 map in the `resepective processor's alternative function "
"table "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/scripts>`__"
" for further reference."
msgstr ""
"若要读取模拟电压型RSSI，:ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>` "
"可设置为任意空闲的ADC引脚。在Pixhawk/Cube类型飞控板上，这包括sBus输出/RSSI输入引脚（103）。使用专用ADC引脚时，对应的引脚编号通常与该引脚上使用的ADC1通道号相匹配。更多参考信息请参阅"
" `相应处理器的替代功能表 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/scripts>`__"
" 中的DMA1映射。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:79
