#: 25e8ec3da834421bb1f06903da779076 8289708efec141a8851a7eed77e8a562
#: ff2f8e5e5b614688880d651219fb6168
msgid "Displaying the RC receiver's RSSI value in MissionPlanner's HUD"
msgstr "在Mission Planner的HUD上显示RC接收机的RSSI值"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:81
#: 25fd8c658678483ea2fbfc5131541049 48180e1504034608a85f901e24786983
#: a192eb8e41f94fa8bd9642f186662319 b8bfe68ae1264553b0abbdfb7fe410fb
#: f53a1ca6756343d5923bc4b4b74d1563
msgid ""
"Once you have set up RSSI correctly on your autopilot, the corresponding "
"values will be sent to your groundstation within the telemetry stream and "
"can be displayed on your GCS. Additionally, your RC receiver's RSSI will be "
"logged and can be displayed on your onboard or standalone OSD."
msgstr ""
"在飞控上正确设置RSSI后，相应数值将通过数传流发送到地面站并可在GCS上显示。此外，RC接收机的RSSI将被记录，并可在机载或独立OSD上显示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:83
#: 28a171242c804e698dd48bf497043b0c 4d328b46d3bc41678b84db7ee3a476bd
