#: fc6dc1199b2b490f8777d51eb74c5420
msgid ""
"It is crucial to select  rxrssi  to display the RC link's rssi, while the "
"items  rssi  and  remrssi  are used to display a radio modem's ground- and "
"remote-transceiver's signal strength indication."
msgstr ""
"务必选择 rxrssi 以显示RC链路的信号强度，而 rssi 和 remrssi 项目用于显示无线电调制解调器的地面和远端收发器信号强度指示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:100
#: 0e63107e725d4bc5ab66f6c15097e56b 21fd1f8a9c9647f3a2af647484b92f86
