msgstr "连接示例"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:102
#: 0c0f978bb0fc484db22caf64e0277a4b 222ea3d70ab941e3aface9d461144d59
#: 2ed945b5390041a1b9559669b7fdd1cc 31bd5077c0194ba6876864688a4c8ebb
#: 6e709f3007f246ecaa91b409844468f0
msgid "Below are examples of typical RC receiver RSSI connection schemes:"
msgstr "以下为典型RC接收机RSSI连接方案示例："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:106
#: 1bc4768cf189448bac2dcb5c9a0844e7 509088bde19c4f88b108ea9079135d49
#: ab9f5c2346984a82ab741aba651e5405 d765eac5e86d45899ca5eb51b067edac
#: e476793ee6b84e659aec363b8f983be3
msgid "RSSI embedded in a collective PPM / sum signal's channel"
msgstr "RSSI嵌入集合PPM/求和信号通道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:108
#: 3821ea09c1af47d1a6cda885f76a3e78 4e6d8cd9133a4a4d9087bedf4f833779
#: 7b5584ba099445f59f8310c4c6ff034d 9a194a37ef4c462abbd06ec44bf34c95
#: cdc8067e4aa742988f4d41040ff6d06d
msgid ""
"It is common practice to feed all RC channels from your RC receiver to your "
"autopilot using a cPPM or sBus type sum signal on a single signal wire. Most"
" UHF type RC systems like EZUHF, OpenLRS, Crossfire or DragonLink support "
"embedding RSSI into a dedicated channel within this collective / sum signal "
"stream. As per ArduPilot default channels 1-4 are used as input for primary "
"control (roll, pitch, throttle, yaw), any channel number above 4 can be used"
" to embed RSSI. Usually, these systems use a GUI to assign RSSI to a "
"dedicated channel slot on your RC receiver, or have it set to a standard "
"channel by default. See your respective system's user manual for reference."
msgstr ""
"通常通过cPPM或sBus类型的求和信号在单根信号线上将所有RC通道从RC接收机传送到飞控。大多数UHF型RC系统（如EZUHF、OpenLRS、Crossfire或DragonLink）支持将RSSI嵌入该集合/求和信号流中的专用通道。根据ArduPilot默认设置，1-4通道用于主控输入（横滚、俯仰、油门、偏航），4以上的任意通道均可用于嵌入RSSI。通常，这些系统使用图形界面将RSSI分配到RC接收机上的专用通道槽，或默认设置为标准通道。具体说明请参阅相应系统的用户手册。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:110
#: 1a3c96b56bd540a8bf6fcb4c52656aa9 6eada0d5a6e249a796b0ff0ae32d0f1d
#: c1371ee570d04279a46a5d766167d271 d98efef8944845cf9a0a994df267b326
#: db8c80b8e7c4410cbcdce374e80a97bd
msgid ""
"If there is an existing RC receiver connection to your autopilot, no "
"additional wiring is required for using embedded RSSI:"
msgstr "如果飞控已有RC接收机连接，则使用嵌入式RSSI无需额外布线："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:115
#: 752186d5d48b4eecb296f188cfa9d4de 961e81e3d8584148829ecb47299d38b5
#: ca4e1637412543238d34c663a9d4b959 d74e4121c6fd4419b0e5b5ebc52fd310
#: f65b7cba81af48108ab4fdb159836917
msgid ""
"The example below shows how to assign channel 5 to embed RSSI on a "
"DragonLink RC receiver:"
msgstr "以下示例展示如何在DragonLink RC接收机上将通道5分配为嵌入RSSI："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:120
#: 77dddff79fb5456e8c9c379886911104 8af0c3a399784495b00d5703fd540530
#: bad0816b08074f2da09423bf79f22232 bf166dab5ad94c03a5dee9770991ee59
#: e4c52c617fe34963a4b672329f95251c
msgid ""
"RSSI values will be output both within the PPM stream on signal pin 1 as "
"well as within the sBus stream on pin 4. Either can be fed to your "
"autopilot's RCInput pin."
msgstr "RSSI值将同时通过信号引脚1上的PPM流和引脚4上的sBus流输出。任一输出均可接入飞控的RCInput引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:122
#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:160
#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:204
#: 053b0abd25af4b13b5dee4e8a5593c02 0b7016782e3c4724ae569796bab9a7e2
