msgstr ":ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` = 2（如果之前默认设为0，需要重新加载参数）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:126
#: 28082771afa242c09057082f18a3c709 78af41225f614a9186c652e85255073c
#: da3603e7c3dc406789aa6e498ffd2be0 f1efe57fcaaf42b2851db5d58e2e94a8
#: f754c43f4685453ea41b76c370d56691
msgid ""
":ref:`RSSI_CHANNEL<RSSI_CHANNEL>`  = the channel used to embed RSSI on your "
"RC receiver (Ch5 in the above example)"
msgstr ":ref:`RSSI_CHANNEL<RSSI_CHANNEL>` = 在RC接收机上用于嵌入RSSI的通道（上例中为第5通道）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:128
#: 173a6da70b1941c6ba85365309055ef3 5d5cf24c1698489d8bd0d8407e9c5a09
#: 63112529452f46a1a42ee7533462c414 8dc9aa2df41d4dd8923b80b19550ddc1
#: 96f6727b803d4813a8dcf23d311cb7f5
msgid ""
":ref:`RSSI_CHAN_HIGH<RSSI_CHAN_HIGH>`  = channel value at strongest "
"reception"
msgstr ":ref:`RSSI_CHAN_HIGH<RSSI_CHAN_HIGH>` = 信号最强时的通道值"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:130
#: 1e586112584e4b48bfc48b72391f436a 1e7b43c59f4b4419b9657386eb1ce085
#: 43e6c3c182174f7496454acb62830b3d be9e5ce2330048629b84adc0e09585df
#: e7b625dd3843481fa86f56acc05e38d4
msgid ""
":ref:`RSSI_CHAN_LOW<RSSI_CHAN_LOW>`  = channel value at weakest reception"
msgstr ":ref:`RSSI_CHAN_LOW<RSSI_CHAN_LOW>` = 信号最弱时的通道值"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:132
#: 19e98da6db5b450f99c65c96a3be7ec3 4485a7a0fa814669afba903ede897abd
#: 79fb45006f184e7b9a492c580e86c712 8b73a3b0e7de45a3a8a2c420195aebcd
#: abc9bd918a3a4325ba827835281c8afa
msgid ""
"Displaying  rxssi  alongside with the respective RC channel's input value in"
" your GCS helps to adjust the value range to match a 0 - 100% RSSI scale:"
msgstr "在GCS中将 rxssi 与相应RC通道输入值一起显示，有助于调整数值范围以匹配0 - 100% RSSI刻度："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:137
#: 04211021f9e644fe8921b5d4a3733315 0b0b33022e9a479190eabefa20ce5f4f
#: 1c3c2f571d564ef3b600f9ca42f4b4e5 d63fdc9a56614f3e8ff24a83825fc815
#: ebdbe3a00a3943369e48c7d6243255ff
msgid ""
"At strongest reception, Ch5 shows a PWM value of 1904 us. With the "
"transmitter switched off, it will drop to 1093 us. Setting  "
":ref:`RSSI_CHAN_HIGH<RSSI_CHAN_HIGH>`  and  "
":ref:`RSSI_CHAN_LOW<RSSI_CHAN_LOW>`  respectively allows to scale the used "
"PWM range to 0 - 100 % with optimal resolution."
msgstr ""
"信号最强时，第5通道显示PWM值为1904 us。关闭遥控器后，将降至1093 us。分别设置 "
":ref:`RSSI_CHAN_HIGH<RSSI_CHAN_HIGH>` 和 :ref:`RSSI_CHAN_LOW<RSSI_CHAN_LOW>` "
"可将使用的PWM范围以最佳分辨率缩放至0 - 100%。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:140
#: 0b294fb811f14cea864ca937a3329f10 58008394dd874c2eb60fd9716c8d8503
#: 5d441a3642894b02895180eee492fa01 72e5dcb02c51463aaa5b0a2186fb428c
#: a974c083151b4aa186b5a31783502205
msgid ""
"Certain sBus protocol variances may lead to channel values not being updated"
" during receiver failsafe conditions. In this case, you will see the last "
"valid RSSI value displayed during a failsafe. As the received signal "
"strength usually gradually decreases under flight conditions, this will "
"likely not have any negative effects. However, during setup and testing it "
"might be confusing to see RSSI freezed at a compareably high value while "
"your RC transmitter is actually switched off."
msgstr ""
"某些sBus协议变体在接收机失控保护期间可能导致通道值不更新。这种情况下，在失控保护期间将显示最后一个有效的RSSI值。由于飞行条件下接收信号强度通常逐渐下降，这通常不会产生负面影响。但在设置和测试期间，当遥控器实际上已关闭时，RSSI仍显示较高值可能令人困惑。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:145
#: 222c8c5dc3aa4655a6f5cec6b0942ac4 2ad1a6ab14354ba9b253a2502fb231f1
#: 7d640dac4c604246ac8d9d0faeb64eaf 8fe9a952253f4119bb6b066edd43051f
#: bd11b6f798674ab483feab9c998a7d40
msgid "Analog voltage type RSSI fed to a dedicated pin"
msgstr "模拟电压型RSSI接入专用引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:147
#: 14de2246389541cc9238716afe0ed1cc 3728e5123eb14bce9df497a89e3a8063
#: 5674e950c91c44c8972ee5a56e57121f cd68a8aaba70488391956800ce884047
#: d01fd642572e4caca63d6224995a5a93
msgid ""
"If your RC receiver outputs an analog voltage range type RSSI, you can feed "
"this to your autopilot's analog RSSI input pin. Typical voltage range is 0 -"
" 3,3V or 0 - 5V. See your RC system's manual for detail or check using a "
"multimeter."
msgstr ""
"如果RC接收机输出模拟电压范围型RSSI，可将其接入飞控的模拟RSSI输入引脚。典型电压范围为0 - 3.3V或0 - "
"5V。具体说明请参阅RC系统手册或使用万用表检测。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:151
#: 05066d7816d04c4e8495848955a59c1a 399417c006e54c26ae30228876f1393d
#: 9480825c07a045bea727c18ded35f64d b0e7a0fda61047a48229c9edd2239fa9
#: e47ad2a9153f48879dd869363b06e17f
msgid ""
"Mind that though most autopilots' input pins theoretically are 5V tolerant, "
"most ADCs will only measure up to 3,3 - 3,6 V unless equipped with voltage "
"dividers to scale down higher input voltages. Check your RC receiver's RSSI "
"voltage as well as your autopilot's specifications to ensure compatibility."
msgstr ""
"请注意，尽管大多数飞控的输入引脚理论上耐5V，但除非配备分压器对较高输入电压进行降压，大多数ADC只能测量至3.3 - "
"3.6V。请检查RC接收机的RSSI电压以及飞控规格，以确保兼容性。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:154
#: 179bda0fff3d45639fe5cf0cbb656c51 4d921b2a0d894304a3e17aa22645faae
#: 6cb8031e26c74604a6d88f5c7c03af96 6e79f77bb1aa4edeb826d3c7374737dd
#: b7de162ccaea4114b1ea8550f5ab65bc
msgid ""
"If there is an existing RC receiver connection to your autopilot that "
"includes supply voltage and ground, only one additional signal wire is "
"required. The example below shows how to connect a receiver's analog voltage"
" type RSSI to a pixhawk autopilot's sBus output pin:"
msgstr ""
"如果飞控已有包含供电电压和地线的RC接收机连接，则只需额外增加一根信号线。以下示例展示如何将接收机的模拟电压型RSSI连接到Pixhawk飞控的sBus输出引脚："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:162
#: 0cdec4772916477faac1cb6b4c2df5bc 214b80f5c6994f418b6395c576eef20f
#: b6253947ac49465aa2834450c6e7d7f3 b944f4efd998469baa025a4cb13f133e
#: fb820994f8fd464c94d345ec9f4c61c1
msgid ""
":ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>`  = 1 (requires parameter reload if set to "
"default 0 previously)"
msgstr ":ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` = 1（如果之前默认设为0，需要重新加载参数）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:164
#: 0d7e8c9dcbf84fa4bee345660937c552 30642d91fb3f4b7fa2044048452c723e
#: 3acd0c9298db487ab21167843ce0e906 5165b2e997dd47dc943231f794efd9fd
