"**R7003SB** receiver to **\"Mode A\"**. Check out your `R7008SB "
"<http://manuals.hobbico.com/fut/r7008sb-manual.pdf>`__ or `R7003SB "
"<http://manuals.hobbico.com/fut/r7003sb-manual.pdf>`__  user manual for "
"further details."
