#: da99d5c225ce48c4bb61b7f45c50a58f e515b57f103942039a8f2d9322e17fa8
msgid ""
"For non-standard RSSI types like some FrSky receivers' high frequency PWM "
"RSSI, an RC filter can be used to level the signal, rendering it usable for "
"the autopilot's analog RSSI input pin:"
msgstr ""
"对于非标准的 RSSI 类型，例如某些 FrSky 接收机的高频 PWM RSSI，可以使用 RC 滤波器对信号进行平滑处理，使其可用于飞控的模拟 "
"RSSI 输入引脚："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:269
